WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:01,550
hello

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,840
Are you the brother of the Jiang family?

3
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:04,280
I just moved here today

4
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:06,160
I'm causing trouble for you and Grandma Lin.

5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,200
Just call me by my name

6
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,760
I'm not feeling well

7
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:12,800
Can you do me a favor or something?

8
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,880
I want to save that butterfly

9
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:16,760
But I don’t want to touch the Pearl King with my bare hands

10
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:18,600
Can you pass me the water? OK?

11
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:29,930
What's wrong, Ke Ke?

12
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:31,250
It's okay grandma

13
00:00:31,410 --> 00:00:32,770
She's just scared of spiders

14
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:35,450
I have nothing to do and I like to raise flowers and vegetables.

15
00:00:35,690 --> 00:00:37,290
Inevitably there are some little bugs

16
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:39,490
Next time you see it, tell me

17
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:40,970
I just caught it for you

18
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:42,770
I'm fine, grandma

19
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:47,340
why are you doing this

20
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:48,980
It's my turn to ask you this question

21
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:51,990
No matter what your purpose is in finding my grandma

22
00:00:52,540 --> 00:00:55,540
You'd better pack up and leave as soon as possible or else

23
00:00:55,940 --> 00:00:56,980
What happened today

24
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,100
just the beginning

25
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:02,180
I think you misunderstood something

26
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:05,380
Grandma Lin and I just have a normal lease, a normal lease

27
00:01:05,740 --> 00:01:07,380
Normal ways for college students to rent a house

28
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:08,700
It should be all kinds of rental software

29
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:09,860
Or just go to an agent directly.

30
00:01:09,980 --> 00:01:12,740
What's the point of sneaking into Qinglan Courtyard to find out about my grandma?

31
00:01:13,060 --> 00:01:14,740
As expected of a writer of Xuanyi novels

32
00:01:15,060 --> 00:01:16,020
Really thoughtful

33
00:01:16,540 --> 00:01:17,980
That rhetoric to Grandma Lin

34
00:01:18,220 --> 00:01:19,820
It seems there is no way to convince her

35
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:21,100
You guessed it right

36
00:01:21,540 --> 00:01:23,220
I'm here for you
